{"type":"p","id":"sea-1","segs":[{"en":"Xiaolan asked, “So which river is the best?”","tok":[["小兰","Xiǎolán","Xiaolan (girl's name)","N"],["问","wèn"],"：","“",["那","nà"],["哪","nǎ"],["条","tiáo"],["河","hé"],["最好","zuìhǎo"],["呢","ne"],"？","”"]},{"en":"Grandpa didn't answer. He found a place on the map: Qinghai.","tok":[["爷爷","yéye"],["没有","méiyǒu"],["回答","huídá"],"，",["他","tā"],["在","zài"],["地图","dìtú"],["上","shàng"],["找到","zhǎodào"],["了","le"],["一","yī"],["个","gè"],["地方","dìfang"],"：",["青海","Qīnghǎi","Qinghai (province)","N"],"。"]},{"en":"“Look, the Yangtze and the Yellow River both flow out of Qinghai. They are like two children who come from the same home.”","tok":["“",["你们","nǐmen"],["看","kàn"],"，",["长江","Cháng Jiāng","the Yangtze River","N"],["和","hé"],["黄河","Huáng Hé","the Yellow River","N"],["都","dōu"],["是","shì"],["从","cóng"],["青海","Qīnghǎi","Qinghai (province)","N"],["流","liú"],["出来","chūlai"],["的","de"],"。",["它们","tāmen"],["像","xiàng"],["两","liǎng"],["个","gè"],["孩子","háizi"],"，",["是","shì"],["从","cóng"],["一","yī"],["个","gè"],["家里","jiāli"],["出来","chūlái"],["的","de"],"。","”"]},{"en":"“One goes south, the other goes north. They travel thousands of kilometres, and in the end both reach the sea.”","tok":["“",["一","yī"],["条","tiáo"],["往","wǎng"],["南","nán"],["走","zǒu"],"，",["一","yī"],["条","tiáo"],["往","wǎng"],["北","běi"],["走","zǒu"],"，",["走","zǒu"],["了","le"],["几千","jǐqiān"],["公里","gōnglǐ"],"，",["最后","zuìhòu"],["都","dōu"],["到","dào"],["了","le"],["大海","dàhǎi"],"。","”"]}],"zh":"小兰问：“那哪条河最好呢？”爷爷没有回答，他在地图上找到了一个地方：青海。“你们看，长江和黄河都是从青海流出来的。它们像两个孩子，是从一个家里出来的。”“一条往南走，一条往北走，走了几千公里，最后都到了大海。”"}
{"type":"p","id":"sea-2","segs":[{"en":"Grandpa went on, “Did you know? I was born by the Yellow River and grew up in Lanzhou. When I was twenty, I went to Chongqing, and I drove boats on the Yangtze for thirty years.”","tok":[["爷爷","yéye"],["又","yòu"],["说","shuō"],"：","“",["你们","nǐmen"],["知道","zhīdào"],["吗","ma"],"？",["我","wǒ"],["在","zài"],["黄河","Huáng Hé","the Yellow River","N"],["边","biān"],["上","shàng"],["出生","chūshēng"],"，",["在","zài"],["兰州","Lánzhōu","Lanzhou (city on the Yellow River)","N"],["长大","zhǎngdà"],"。",["二十","èrshí"],["岁","suì"],["的","de"],["时候","shíhou"],"，",["我","wǒ"],["去","qù"],["了","le"],["重庆","Chóngqìng","Chongqing (city on the Yangtze)","N"],"，",["在","zài"],["长江","Cháng Jiāng","the Yangtze River","N"],["上","shàng"],["开","kāi"],["了","le"],["三十","sānshí"],["年","nián"],["船","chuán"],"。","”"]},{"en":"“I know!” said Xiaochuan. “Because Grandpa worked in Chongqing, my dad was born in Chongqing.”","tok":[["小川","Xiǎochuān","Xiaochuan (boy's name)","N"],["说","shuō"],"：","“",["我","wǒ"],["知道","zhīdào"],"！",["因为","yīnwèi"],["爷爷","yéye"],["在","zài"],["重庆","Chóngqìng","Chongqing (city on the Yangtze)","N"],["工作","gōngzuò"],"，",["所以","suǒyǐ"],["我","wǒ"],["爸爸","bàba"],["是","shì"],["在","zài"],["重庆","Chóngqìng","Chongqing (city on the Yangtze)","N"],["出生","chūshēng"],["的","de"],"。","”"]},{"en":"Xiaolan said, “My mum was born in Chongqing too. Later she came back to Lanzhou with Grandpa.”","tok":[["小兰","Xiǎolán","Xiaolan (girl's name)","N"],["说","shuō"],"：","“",["我","wǒ"],["妈妈","māma"],["也","yě"],["是","shì"],["在","zài"],["重庆","Chóngqìng","Chongqing (city on the Yangtze)","N"],["出生","chūshēng"],["的","de"],"，",["后来","hòulái"],["她","tā"],["跟","gēn"],["爷爷","yéye"],["回","huí"],["了","le"],["兰州","Lánzhōu","Lanzhou (city on the Yellow River)","N"],"。","”"]}],"zh":"爷爷又说：“你们知道吗？我在黄河边上出生，在兰州长大。二十岁的时候，我去了重庆，在长江上开了三十年船。”小川说：“我知道！因为爷爷在重庆工作，所以我爸爸是在重庆出生的。”小兰说：“我妈妈也是在重庆出生的，后来她跟爷爷回了兰州。”"}
{"type":"p","id":"sea-3","segs":[{"en":"Grandpa smiled. “So the Yangtze is Xiaochuan's river and the Yellow River is Xiaolan's river, and both of them are our family's rivers. Which one is better? Both are!”","tok":[["爷爷","yéye"],["笑","xiào"],["着","zhe"],["说","shuō"],"：","“",["所以","suǒyǐ"],"，",["长江","Cháng Jiāng","the Yangtze River","N"],["是","shì"],["小川","Xiǎochuān","Xiaochuan (boy's name)","N"],["的","de"],["河","hé"],"，",["黄河","Huáng Hé","the Yellow River","N"],["是","shì"],["小兰","Xiǎolán","Xiaolan (girl's name)","N"],["的","de"],["河","hé"],"，",["这","zhè"],["两","liǎng"],["条","tiáo"],["河","hé"],["都","dōu"],["是","shì"],["我们","wǒmen"],["家","jiā"],["的","de"],["河","hé"],"。",["哪","nǎ"],["条","tiáo"],["河","hé"],["好","hǎo"],"？",["两","liǎng"],["条","tiáo"],["都","dōu"],["好","hǎo"],"！","”"]},{"en":"Xiaochuan and Xiaolan looked at the map, then at Grandpa, and they both laughed.","tok":[["小川","Xiǎochuān","Xiaochuan (boy's name)","N"],["和","hé"],["小兰","Xiǎolán","Xiaolan (girl's name)","N"],["看看","kànkan"],["地图","dìtú"],"，",["又","yòu"],["看看","kànkan"],["爷爷","yéye"],"，",["都","dōu"],["笑","xiào"],["了","le"],"。"]}],"zh":"爷爷笑着说：“所以，长江是小川的河，黄河是小兰的河，这两条河都是我们家的河。哪条河好？两条都好！”小川和小兰看看地图，又看看爷爷，都笑了。"}
{"type":"p","id":"sea-4","segs":[{"en":"The next day, the two of them went down to the Yellow River together again.","tok":[["第二天","dì'èrtiān"],"，",["两","liǎng"],["个","gè"],["人","rén"],["又","yòu"],["一起","yīqǐ"],["去","qù"],["了","le"],["黄河","Huáng Hé","the Yellow River","N"],["边","biān"],["上","shàng"],"。"]},{"en":"Xiaochuan said, “Come to Chongqing next summer. I'll take you to see the Yangtze and ride on the big boats.”","tok":[["小川","Xiǎochuān","Xiaochuan (boy's name)","N"],["说","shuō"],"：","“",["明年","míngnián"],["夏天","xiàtiān"],["你","nǐ"],["来","lái"],["重庆","Chóngqìng","Chongqing (city on the Yangtze)","N"],["吧","ba"],"，",["我","wǒ"],["带","dài"],["你","nǐ"],["去","qù"],["看","kàn"],["长江","Cháng Jiāng","the Yangtze River","N"],"，",["坐","zuò"],["长江","Cháng Jiāng","the Yangtze River","N"],["上","shàng"],["的","de"],["大","dà"],["船","chuán"],"。","”"]},{"en":"Xiaolan smiled. “OK! But don't say the Yangtze is better than the Yellow River any more.”","tok":[["小兰","Xiǎolán","Xiaolan (girl's name)","N"],["笑","xiào"],["着","zhe"],["说","shuō"],"：","“",["好","hǎo"],["啊","a"],"！",["可是","kěshì"],["你","nǐ"],["别","bié"],["再","zài"],["说","shuō"],["长江","Cháng Jiāng","the Yangtze River","N"],["比","bǐ"],["黄河","Huáng Hé","the Yellow River","N"],["好","hǎo"],["了","le"],"。","”"]},{"en":"Xiaochuan laughed too. “All right, no more comparing. The Yangtze is just as good as the Yellow River!”","tok":[["小川","Xiǎochuān","Xiaochuan (boy's name)","N"],["也","yě"],["笑","xiào"],["了","le"],"：","“",["好","hǎo"],"，",["我","wǒ"],["不","bù"],["比","bǐ"],["了","le"],"。",["长江","Cháng Jiāng","the Yangtze River","N"],["跟","gēn"],["黄河","Huáng Hé","the Yellow River","N"],["一样","yīyàng"],["好","hǎo"],"！","”"]}],"zh":"第二天，两个人又一起去了黄河边上。小川说：“明年夏天你来重庆吧，我带你去看长江，坐长江上的大船。”小兰笑着说：“好啊！可是你别再说长江比黄河好了。”小川也笑了：“好，我不比了。长江跟黄河一样好！”"}
